SC injections from Week 1 through Week 16."},{"id":"OG001","title":"Bermekimab 400 mg q2w (Week 0 - 16)","description":"Participants received bermekimab 800 milligrams (mg) (400mg*2) loading dose SC injection at Week 0 followed by bermekimab 400 mg SC injections every 2 weeks (q2w) alternating with matching placebo q2w through Week 16."},{"id":"OG002","title":"Bermekimab 400 mg qw (Week 0 - 16)","description":"Participants received bermekimab 400 mg loading dose SC injection along with matching placebo loading dose SC injection at Week 0 followed by weekly (qw) SC injections of bermekimab 400 mg (2*200 mg per mL) through Week 16."},{"id":"OG003","title":"Placebo Then Bermekimab 400 mg qw (Week 16 - 31)","description":"After completion of placebo-controlled period, participants were crossed-over to active treatment period and received bermekimab 400 mg SC injection qw at Week 16 through Week 31."},{"id":"OG004","title":"Bermekimab 400 mg q2w (Week 16 - 31)","description":"After completion of placebo-controlled period, participants entered active treatment period and continued to receive bermekimab 400 mg SC injection q2w alternating with matching placebo through Week 31."},{"id":"OG005","title":"Bermekimab 400 mg qw (Week 16 - 31)","description":"After completion of placebo-controlled period, participants entered active treatment period and continued to receive bermekimab 400 mg SC injection qw through Week 31."}],"denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"15"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"12"},{"groupId":"OG002","value":"17"},{"groupId":"OG003","value":"14"},{"groupId":"OG004","value":"12"},{"groupId":"OG005","value":"17"}]}],"classes":[{"title":"Week 4","denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"15"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"12"},{"groupId":"OG002","value":"17"},{"groupId":"OG003","value":"0"},{"groupId":"OG004","value":"0"},{"groupId":"OG005","value":"0"}]}],"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG00